 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "scen078.0000",
   "jp": "",
   "en": "",
   "term": "null"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0001",
   "jp": "鉱夫",
   "en": "Miner",
   "term": "null",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0002",
   "jp": "{v:0037}ふぅっ、やっと出られた‥‥。",
   "en": "{v:0037}Whew, finally out...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0003",
   "jp": "{v:0038}この地鳴りは‥‥。",
   "en": "{v:0038}That rumbling...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0004",
   "jp": "{v:0039}みんな、無事か！？",
   "en": "{v:0039}Is everyone all right?!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0005",
   "jp": "{v:003A}い、生きてるぅ～！",
   "en": "{v:003A}I-I'm aliiive!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0006",
   "jp": "{v:003B}ケガはないみたい。",
   "en": "{v:003B}It looks like no one's hurt.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0007",
   "jp": "{v:003C}大丈夫みたいね。",
   "en": "{v:003C}Looks like we're all right.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0008",
   "jp": "{v:003D}まさか突然噴火するとはな。{n}さっきの溶岩が止まったことといい、{n}不可解な事が多い‥‥。",
   "en": "{v:003D}Never thought it'd erupt out of nowhere. First the lava{n}stopped, now this. Too much here doesn't add up...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0009",
   "jp": "{v:003E}何とか生きてるね‥‥。",
   "en": "{v:003E}Somehow, we're still alive...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0010",
   "jp": "{v:003F}ガスが噴き出してきちまったな。{n}準備をしてもう一度出直すとするか。",
   "en": "",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0011",
   "jp": "ブレーム火山",
   "en": "Brehm Volcano",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0012",
   "jp": "ちょっと！{n}いったんガスがおさまるのを待たないと{n}危ないでしょ！",
   "en": "Hey! It's dangerous unless we wait for the gas to{n}stop first!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0013",
   "jp": "{v:0004}このブレーム山の内部には{n}火山の猛毒ガスが噴き出している。{p}{v:0005}ガスは定期的に止まるが、時間がたつとまた噴き出す。{n}その短時間に戻ってこなけりゃ、毒ガスの餌食だ。",
   "en": "",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0014",
   "jp": "{v:0006}うひ～。{n}何だかやだなぁ‥‥。",
   "en": "{v:0006}Eeeugh. I don't like the sound of that...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0015",
   "jp": "{v:0007}でもいつ止まるの？",
   "en": "{v:0007}But when does it stop?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0016",
   "jp": "{v:0008}それまでは知らん。",
   "en": "{v:0008}That, I don't know.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0017",
   "jp": "‥‥{v:0009}間もなくだ。{n}間もなくガスの噴出が止まる。",
   "en": "...{v:0009}Soon. The gas will stop flowing soon.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0018",
   "jp": "{v:000A}えっ？",
   "en": "{v:000A}Huh?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0019",
   "jp": "{FFF6}{v:000B}もし奥でクリアノ草を取ってくるのなら、{n}それなりの準備をした方が良いぞ。",
   "en": "{FFF6}{v:000B}If you're going deep inside to gather Kuriano Herb,{n}you'd best prepare accordingly.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0020",
   "jp": "{v:000C}ちょっと、ミーシャ？",
   "en": "{v:000C}Um, Misha?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0021",
   "jp": "{FFF6}{FFF3}‥‥‥。",
   "en": "{FFF6}{FFF3}...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0022",
   "jp": "{v:000D}ミーシャったら！",
   "en": "{v:000D}Misha!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0023",
   "jp": "‥‥{v:000E}あら？{p}{FB00}{v:000F}どうしたの、ルイセちゃん。{FFFA}",
   "en": "...{v:000E}Oh?{p}{FB00}{v:000F}What is it, Luise-chan?{FFFA}",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0024",
   "jp": "{v:0010}どうしたのって{FE14}‥{FE14}‥{FE14}{FC02}えぇ？",
   "en": "{v:0010}What do you mean{FE14}.{FE14}.{FE14}{FC02}Huh?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0025",
   "jp": "{v:0011}そんなに慌てちゃって？{n}何かあったの？",
   "en": "{v:0011}You're so flustered! Did something happen?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0026",
   "jp": "‥‥{v:0012}あんた、何も覚えていないの？",
   "en": "...{v:0012}You don't remember a thing?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0027",
   "jp": "‥‥{v:0013}ん？",
   "en": "...{v:0013}Hmm?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0028",
   "jp": "{v:0014}おい、ガスが止まったぞ。{n}どうやらその娘の言った通りになったな。",
   "en": "{v:0014}Hey, the gas stopped. Looks like that girl was right.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0029",
   "jp": "‥‥{v:0015}ん？",
   "en": "...{v:0015}Hmm?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0030",
   "jp": "{v:0016}またガスが出ているよ。",
   "en": "{v:0016}The gas is coming out again.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0031",
   "jp": "{v:0017}大丈夫だ。間もなく止まる‥‥。",
   "en": "{v:0017}It's all right. It'll stop soon...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0032",
   "jp": "‥‥{v:0018}本当だ。",
   "en": "...{v:0018}You're right.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0033",
   "jp": "お前さん達、こんな危険なところへ何の用だ？",
   "en": "What brings you folks to a dangerous place like this?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0034",
   "jp": "別に用ってほどの事じゃないんだけど‥‥。",
   "en": "Well, we don't really have any particular{n}business here...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0035",
   "jp": "ここは危険なところで、{n}地元の者でも絶対に足を踏み入れないんだ。{p}もし鉱山街に行きたいなら、分かれ道を北に。{n}温泉の街コムスプリングスへ行くなら、{n}南に進めばいい。",
   "en": "This place is dangerous. Even the locals won't set{n}foot inside.{p}If you're going to the mining town, head north at the{n}fork. For the hot spring town of Comsprings,{n}head south.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0036",
   "jp": "どうしたの、ルイセちゃん？",
   "en": "What's wrong, Luise-chan?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0037",
   "jp": "あのね、お兄ちゃん。{n}この火山の中だと、テレポート出来ないみたい‥‥。",
   "en": "Um, Big Brother... I don't think I can use Teleport inside{n}this volcano...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0038",
   "jp": "え～～っ！？",
   "en": "Whaaat?!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0039",
   "jp": "まさか、このガスの中に{n}魔法を妨害するような成分があるってのか？",
   "en": "You mean there's something in this gas that interferes{n}with magic?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0040",
   "jp": "他の魔法は使えそうだけど、{n}テレポートだけはダメだよ‥‥。{p}全然集中できないの！",
   "en": "I think I can use other magic, but Teleport just{n}won't work...{p}I can't concentrate at all!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0041",
   "jp": "おい。{n}俺たちの命は{s:0000}に預ける。{n}お前の判断がすべてだ。",
   "en": "Listen. We're putting our lives in your hands,{n}{s:0000}. It all comes down to{n}your judgment.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0042",
   "jp": "お兄さま、頼みますぅ♪",
   "en": "We're counting on you, Big Brother♪",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0043",
   "jp": "{FB00}緊張感のない娘‥‥。",
   "en": "{FB00}Does this girl even know what danger is...?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0044",
   "jp": "バカ！{n}焼け死にたいの！？",
   "en": "Idiot! Do you want to burn to death?!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0045",
   "jp": "『{FFEF}秘伝書{FFF1}』を見つけたが、{n}これ以上、持つことはできない‥‥。",
   "en": "Found '{FFEF}Secret Manual{FFF1}', but you can't carry any more...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0046",
   "jp": "　{n}　　　　　　『{FFEF}秘伝書{FFF1}』を手に入れた！",
   "en": "　{n}　　　　　　Received '{FFEF}Secret Manual{FFF1}'!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0047",
   "jp": "『{FFEF}生命のリンゴ{FFF1}』を見つけたが、{n}これ以上、持つことはできない‥‥。",
   "en": "Found '{FFEF}Life Apple{FFF1}', but you can't carry any more...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0048",
   "jp": "　{n}　　　　『{FFEF}生命のリンゴ{FFF1}』を手に入れた！",
   "en": "　{n}　　　　Received '{FFEF}Life Apple{FFF1}'!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0049",
   "jp": "{v:0030}なんだ、この音は？",
   "en": "{v:0030}What's that sound?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0050",
   "jp": "{v:0031}さっきより暑くなってきたよ！？",
   "en": "{v:0031}It's getting even hotter?!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0051",
   "jp": "{v:0032}あっ！{n}アレ！",
   "en": "{v:0032}Ah! Look!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0052",
   "jp": "{v:0033}溶岩が迫ってくる！",
   "en": "{v:0033}The lava's coming this way!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0053",
   "jp": "{v:0034}きゃああっ！",
   "en": "{v:0034}Aaaah!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0054",
   "jp": "{v:0035}溶岩が止まったよ！？",
   "en": "{v:0035}The lava stopped?!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0055",
   "jp": "{v:0036}何してるんだ、今の内に脱出するんだ！",
   "en": "{v:0036}What are you doing?! Get out while we can!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0056",
   "jp": "『{FFEF}ネクタル{FFF1}』を見つけたが、{n}これ以上、持つことはできない‥‥。",
   "en": "Found '{FFEF}Nectar{FFF1}', but you can't carry any more...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0057",
   "jp": "　{n}　　　　　　『{FFEF}ネクタル{FFF1}』を手に入れた！",
   "en": "　{n}　　　　　　Received '{FFEF}Nectar{FFF1}'!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0058",
   "jp": "　{n}　　　　　９５０エルムを手に入れた！",
   "en": "　{n}　　　　　Received 950 Elm!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0059",
   "jp": "『{FFEF}バフコート{FFF1}』を見つけたが、{n}これ以上、持つことはできない‥‥。",
   "en": "Found '{FFEF}Buff Coat{FFF1}', but you can't carry any more...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0060",
   "jp": "　{n}　　　　　『{FFEF}バフコート{FFF1}』を手に入れた！",
   "en": "　{n}　　　　　Obtained '{FFEF}Buff Coat{FFF1}'!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0061",
   "jp": "{v:0020}うわっ！{n}モンスターの集団だ！",
   "en": "{v:0020}Whoa! A whole pack of monsters!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0062",
   "jp": "{v:0021}見て！{n}あそこに生えているあれ！{n}あれがクリアノ草じゃないかな？",
   "en": "{v:0021}Look! That plant growing over there! Could that be{n}Kuriano Herb?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0063",
   "jp": "{v:0022}どうやらこのモンスターを倒さないと近づけないな。{p}{v:0023}時間がない。{n}誰かがクリアノ草を取ったら、急いで脱出しよう。",
   "en": "{v:0022}Looks like we can't get near it without beating{n}these monsters.{p}{v:0023}We're short on time. Once someone grabs the Kuriano{n}Herb, let's get out fast.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0064",
   "jp": "クリアノ草を取らないと！",
   "en": "We have to get the Kuriano Herb!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0065",
   "jp": "{v:002B}これだね？",
   "en": "{v:002B}This is it, right?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0066",
   "jp": "　{n}　　　　　『{FFEF}クリアノ草{FFF1}』を手に入れた！",
   "en": "　{n}　　　　　Obtained '{FFEF}Kuriano Herb{FFF1}'!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0067",
   "jp": "{v:002F}いつガスが噴き出すかわからんぞ。{n}無駄な戦いは避けて、出口へ急ごう！",
   "en": "",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0068",
   "jp": "{v:0029}こ、これ‥‥。",
   "en": "{v:0029}Th-this...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0069",
   "jp": "{v:002A}しまった、ガスだ！",
   "en": "{v:002A}Damn, it's gas!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0070",
   "jp": "{FFF6}{v:0024}あまり時間をかけるな。{n}ガスが噴き出してくるまで時間がないぞ‥‥。",
   "en": "",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0071",
   "jp": "{v:0025}えっ？{n}ミー‥シャ？",
   "en": "{v:0025}Huh? Mi...sha?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0072",
   "jp": "{v:0026}ん？{n}何？",
   "en": "{v:0026}Hm? What?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0073",
   "jp": "‥‥‥{v:0027}何でもない‥‥。",
   "en": "...{v:0027}Nothing...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0074",
   "jp": "{FFF6}{v:0028}急ぐのだ。{n}間もなくガスが噴き出すぞ‥‥。",
   "en": "",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0075",
   "jp": "{v:0019}どうしたの、ミーシャ？",
   "en": "{v:0019}What's wrong, Misha?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0076",
   "jp": "{FFF6}{v:001A}気をつけろ‥‥そろそろガスが噴き出すぞ‥‥。",
   "en": "",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0077",
   "jp": "{v:001B}えっ！{n}それ、本当なの、ミーシャ？",
   "en": "{v:001B}What?! Is that true, Misha?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0078",
   "jp": "‥‥{v:001C}ん？{n}なに？",
   "en": "...{v:001C}Hm? What?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0079",
   "jp": "{v:001D}う～！{n}この娘、変だよぉ！",
   "en": "{v:001D}Ugh! This girl's acting weird!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0080",
   "jp": "{v:001E}えーっ？{n}なに、なに？",
   "en": "{v:001E}Huuuh? What? What is it?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0081",
   "jp": "‥‥{v:001F}もう、いい‥‥。",
   "en": "...{v:001F}Oh, never mind...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen078.0082",
   "jp": "ごめんね、お兄ちゃん。{n}ちょっと無理みたい‥‥。",
   "en": "I'm sorry, Big Brother. I don't think I can...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  }
 ]
}
